# SailChip

**A versatile open-source Hardware Root-of-Trust (HW-RoT) framework for resource-constrained IoT devices.**

SailChip is a generator for lightweight HW-RoTs. More information coming soon.

> [!NOTE]
> This repository accompanies a manuscript, which is currently under review.
> The sources will be made publicly available upon acceptance of the manuscript.

